Route27_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "Hey!\p"
	.string "Do you know what you just did?\p"
	.string "You’ve taken your first step into\n"
	.string "KANTO.\p"
	.string "Check your MAP and see.$"

Route27_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "Do you know what you just did?\p"
	.string "You’ve taken your first step into\n"
	.string "KANTO.\p"
	.string "Check your MAP and see.$"

Route27_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "My favorite part of bathing comes\n"
	.string "up right after this.\p"
	.string "I enjoy a bowl of chowder to\n"
	.string "warm me from the inside, too!$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerMeganIntro::
	.string "It’s rare to see anyone come here.\n"
	.string "Are you training on your own?$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerMeganDefeat::
	.string "Oh! You’re really strong!$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerMegan::
	.string "I’m checking out pre- and post-\n"
	.string "evolution POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Evolution really does make POKéMON\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "But evolved forms also learn moves\n"
	.string "later on.$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBlakeIntro::
	.string "You look pretty strong.\n"
	.string "Let me battle you!$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBlakeDefeat::
	.string "Yow!$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBlake::
	.string "If you prevail on this harsh trek,\n"
	.string "the truth will be revealed!\p"
	.string "Heh, sorry, I just wanted to say\n"
	.string "something cool.$"

Route27_Text_PsychicGilbertIntro::
	.string "Don’t say a thing!\p"
	.string "Let me guess what you’re thinking.\p"
	.string "Mmmmmmm...\p"
	.string "I got it! You’re on the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE challenge!$"

Route27_Text_PsychicGilbertDefeat::
	.string "You’re too much!$"

Route27_Text_PsychicGilbert::
	.string "With your skills, you’ll do well at\n"
	.string "the LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "That’s what my premonition says.$"

Route27_Text_BirdKeeper549Intro::
	.string "Tweet! Tweet!\n"
	.string "Tetweet!$"

Route27_Text_BirdKeeper549Defeat::
	.string "Tweet!$"

Route27_Text_BirdKeeper549::
	.string "BIRD KEEPERS like me mimic bird\n"
	.string "whistles to command POKéMON.$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBrianIntro::
	.string "Hm? You’re good, aren’t you?$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBrianDefeat::
	.string "Just as I thought!$"

Route27_Text_CooltrainerBrian::
	.string "A good trainer can recognize other\n"
	.string "good trainers.$"

Route27_Text_Cooltrainer222Intro::
	.string "You shouldn’t underestimate the\n"
	.string "wild POKéMON in these parts.$"

Route27_Text_Cooltrainer222Defeat::
	.string "Oh! You’re much too strong!$"

Route27_Text_Cooltrainer222::
	.string "You’re just a kid, but you’re not to\n"
	.string "be underestimated either.$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3_1::
	.string "AMELIA: Hi, {PLAYER}! Were you going\n"
	.string "to the POKéMON LEAGUE?\p"
	.string "I wanted to go there to see you\n"
	.string "battling.\p"
	.string "But it seems like I can’t, since\n"
	.string "I don’t know how to use WATERFALL.\p"
	.string "Sigh...\p"
	.string "Oh! I almost forgot!\p"
	.string "I have been training since last time.\p"
	.string "Would you like to battle me?$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3_2::
	.string "AMELIA: Oh, really?\n"
	.string "That’s too bad...\p"
	.string "Well, I won’t take your time, then.\p"
	.string "Sniff...$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3_3::
	.string "AMELIA: All right!\n"
	.string "I will beat you! I’m sure!$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3Defeat::
	.string "Oh... I need more training...$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3Victory::
	.string "I won, I’m happy!$"

Route27_Text_Trigger3_4::
	.string "AMELIA: Well, I’m sure you won’t have\n"
	.string "problems reaching the LEAGUE.\p"
	.string "I wish you the best luck,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Beat that E4 for me! OK?$"

Route27_Text_Sign::
	.string "TOHJO FALLS\n"
	.string "The Link Between KANTO and JOHTO$"
